Better at concentrating,

00:09:38.076 --> 00:09:39.812 size:84% position:42%
better at focusing.

00:09:39.845 --> 00:09:41.747 align:start size:63% position:38%
I wanna heal faster,

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:44.216 align:start size:75% position:25%
and this will probably
be a good idea.

00:09:44.249 --> 00:09:46.685 align:start size:66% position:34%
