 anticipation</i>

00:10:30.696 --> 00:10:33.666
<i> building wait
 outside the lab.</i>

00:10:33.699 --> 00:10:36.201
<i> Then it was time
 for their first scan.</i>

00:10:36.234 --> 00:10:37.670 align:start position:0%
Shall we?

00:10:37.703 --> 00:10:39.672
<i> While the hypothesis
 of this study</i>

00:10:39.705 --> 00:10:40.873
