 the patient heal.</i>

00:11:27.853 --> 00:11:31.190 align:start size:69% position:31%
You might notice
some unusual feelings,

00:11:31.223 --> 00:11:32.791 align:start size:63% position:38%
perhaps a tingling.

00:11:32.824 --> 00:11:35.127 align:start size:75% position:25%
Your brain
is continuing to learn,

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:38.397 align:start size:75% position:25%
and to heal,
and to help you find

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:42.134 align:start size:75% position:25%
