of confidence.

00:11:42.167 --> 00:11:43.736
<i> If all went well,</i>

00:11:43.769 --> 00:11:45.904
<i> the placebo effect
 of the sham brain scanner</i>

00:11:45.937 --> 00:11:48.741
<i> would convince
 the children's conscious minds</i>

00:11:48.774 --> 00:11:51.110
