 was at work.</i>

00:11:51.143 --> 00:11:52.911 align:start size:78% position:22%
Take a deep, deep breath.

00:11:52.944 --> 00:11:55.514 line:0%
<i> This would allow
 their subconscious minds</i>

00:11:55.547 --> 00:11:57.449 line:0%
<i> to harness the power
 of their brains</i>

00:11:57.482 --> 00:11:59.451
<i> to heal themselves.</i>

00:11:59.484 --> 00:12:01.787
For people with migraines,
it's often in the front

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:02.988
