00:12:27.512 --> 00:12:30.916 align:start size:63% position:38%
You might notice
that deeper feeling

00:12:30.949 --> 00:12:33.786 align:start size:44% position:56% line:0%
of relaxation.

00:12:33.819 --> 00:12:35.154 align:start size:22% position:78% line:0%
Yes.

00:12:37.088 --> 00:12:38.491 align:start size:88% position:13% line:0%
Yes.

00:12:44.329 --> 00:12:45.831 line:0%
<i> The scientists at McGill</i>

00:12:45.864 --> 00:12:47.232
<i> believe that children's brains</i>

00:12:47.265 --> 00:12:48.467
