00:13:03.982 --> 00:13:06.018 align:start size:56% position:44%
Right. Very well.

00:13:06.051 --> 00:13:07.986 align:start size:56% position:44%
You did very,
very well, Nathan.

00:13:08.019 --> 00:13:10.489
<i> The children all appeared
