 their neuroenchantment.</i>

00:13:14.459 --> 00:13:18.096 align:start size:88% position:13%
So when you heard
the first set of beeps
and the second set of beeps,

00:13:18.129 --> 00:13:21.166 align:start size:75% position:25%
