00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:25.958 line:0%
<i> The lab's new, more modern
 sham brain scanner</i>

00:15:25.991 --> 00:15:27.426 line:0%
<i> shows even more promise.</i>

00:15:27.459 --> 00:15:30.095 align:start position:0%
And I was invited
to participate in its test

