their thoughts?

00:15:52.417 --> 00:15:53.719 align:start size:56% position:44%
Now, we're looking
at cutting-edge

00:15:53.752 --> 00:15:55.487 line:0%
-psychological research.
-Okay.

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:58.557 line:0%
Yes. It's part of the neural
activation mapping project.

00:15:58.590 --> 00:15:59.658 align:start size:75% position:25%
We're gonna be putting
you in an MRI.

00:15:59.691 --> 00:16:02.561 size:88% position:56%
So, uh, it's a modified one,
it's called the CTMSF MRI.

00:16:02.594 --> 00:16:05.430 align:start size:88% position:13%
-Okay.
-So, Combined Transcranial
 Magnetic Stimulation

