So, you'll be choosing
a number from 10 to 99.

00:16:14.739 --> 00:16:17.576 align:start size:84% position:16%
-Okay.
-[Jay] And then
 from looking at your,

00:16:17.609 --> 00:16:18.777 align:start size:66% position:34%
