patterns,

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.445 align:start size:63% position:38%
Dr. Veissiere here
will try to infer

00:16:20.478 --> 00:16:22.414
-which number you're thinking.
-Hmm, interesting.

00:16:22.447 --> 00:16:23.715
-Okay.
-Okay, great.

00:16:23.748 --> 00:16:26.752
<i> Most adults know
 the basics about MRIs,</i>

