00:22:35.086 --> 00:22:36.821
So, giving them a placebo

00:22:36.854 --> 00:22:39.991
could help a dog's brain
heal itself.

00:22:42.927 --> 00:22:45.964
[Dr. Veissiere]<i> So first
I'll ask you to lie down again.</i>

