00:26:33.057 --> 00:26:35.326 align:start size:63% position:38%
This work is
truly cutting-edge.

00:26:35.359 --> 00:26:36.794 align:start size:63% position:38%
This hasn't
been done before.

00:26:36.827 --> 00:26:39.163 align:start position:0%
Correct.
We also think of this

00:26:39.196 --> 00:26:42.033 align:start position:0%
as a great new way
to do science
and to collaborate.

00:26:42.066 --> 00:26:44.369 size:88% position:56%
 So much more of the public
 will see what's being done.

00:26:44.402 --> 00:26:48.006 align:start size:88% position:13%
Yes. Science isn't just
about publishing a paper
that nobody reads.

00:26:48.039 --> 00:26:49.641
It's about spreading
the ideas that you find.

00:26:49.674 --> 00:26:51.943
-Hundred percent.
-As far as I'm concerned,

00:26:51.976 --> 00:26:53.277 align:start position:0%
you're already
a co-author

00:26:53.310 --> 00:26:55.713 align:start position:0%
in our scientific
experimental paper.

00:26:55.746 --> 00:26:57.716 align:start size:50% position:50%
Wow, very cool.
Thank you.

00:27:03.988 --> 00:27:06.658
The children's improvements
were caused

00:27:06.691 --> 00:27:08.092
by the placebo effect,

00:27:08.125 --> 00:27:11.129
and no deception
was used to mask that.

00:27:11.162 --> 00:27:13.865
The parents knew
the machine was deactivated,

00:27:13.898 --> 00:27:15.800
and the children
were only told

00:27:15.833 --> 00:27:18.136
that it had the power
to put a suggestion

00:27:18.169 --> 00:27:20.271
in their brain, a suggestion

00:27:20.304 --> 00:27:23.241
that ultimately came
