the less effective
they'll be, right?

00:27:31.248 --> 00:27:32.417
No.

00:27:32.450 --> 00:27:34.385
Studies show
that even when subjects

00:27:34.418 --> 00:27:36.988
learn that their treatment
was a placebo,

00:27:37.021 --> 00:27:40.091
the positive results
do not go away.

00:27:40.124 --> 00:27:41.693
What the subjects have learned

00:27:41.726 --> 00:27:43.294
about how to heal themselves

00:27:43.327 --> 00:27:45.263
remains with them.

00:27:45.296 --> 00:27:47.999
It was an honor to have been
a part of this study.

00:27:48.032 --> 00:27:50.868
I think this is<i> Mind Field </i>
at its best,

00:27:50.901 --> 00:27:53.004
using our resources
to help researchers

00:27:53.037 --> 00:27:55.173
with their work
and helping the public

00:27:55.206 --> 00:27:57.942
see how the brain is studied.

00:27:57.975 --> 00:28:00.011
Placebos can't fix everything,

00:28:00.044 --> 00:28:03.014
but these kids
always had the power

00:28:03.047 --> 00:28:04.248
to start healing.

00:28:04.281 --> 00:28:05.483
All they needed

00:28:05.516 --> 00:28:08.753
was the power of suggestion.

00:28:08.786 --> 00:28:11.756
And as always,
thanks for watching.

00:28:13.290 --> 00:28:16.094 line:0%
[theme music playing]

